{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmyu5uA45yoJD4JvHBHX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm keeping it, and I'm fairly sure. What decided it is the line at the top: the employer puts in up to **7.5%** of my salary and I put in **2.5%**. If I leave the money **6 years** after the first payment, the profits are tax-free. I can take it out earlier, it's not locked, but then I pay tax on it. The orange box said **\"משיכה לפני הזמן אפשרית, אבל יקרה\"** (taking it out early is possible but costly), so I'm not touching it before 6 years.\n\nOne thing bugged me. The big bars came out at **17,370 ₪** for the keren against **16,955 ₪** for a securities account, which they called **\"משאירה 415.84 ₪ יותר\"**. After 10 years, that's all? I nearly thought it wasn't worth it. Then I caught a line saying the employer's money **\"מחוץ להשוואה\"**. So the bars are only my own money? I'm not sure I got that right. Showing the employer's money would have made the case straight away.\n\n**Where I looked, in order:**\n1. **Top:** the heading **קרן השתלמות** was exactly what I came for. I read the \"מה זה\" part properly: **6 שנים**, tax-free, \"הכסף לא נעול\", 7.5% and 2.5%.\n2. **\"למה משתמשים בזה\":** first line only.\n3. **\"מה מייחד\":** the example with a salary of 12,000. I didn't touch the salary field or the years slider. I looked at the two big bars and the 415.84 ₪.\n4. **Under the bars:** a small table of fees and tax. I glanced at it and didn't add anything up. A range starting at **\"-342.02 ₪\"** scared me a bit.\n5. **\"שווה לדעת\":** first line, which was 6 years again.\n6. **\"כסף נכנס ויוצא\":** the big text: **\"כשעוברות 6 שנים\"**, and the money reaches me within **\"עד 4 ימי עסקים\"**.\n7. **\"כמה זה עולה\":** management fee **\"עד 2% בשנה\"**. That sounds like nothing to me, but I've heard it isn't.\n8. **\"מיסוי\":** I only took the headings: no tax on profits, tax-free after the waiting period.\n9. **The orange warning box:** first line only.\n\n**What I skipped:** \"מי מציע ומי מפקח\", the company cards, \"סיכונים ומה לא מוגן\", the whole \"מונחים\" table of terms, the folds (\"שחקו עם המספרים שלכם\", \"שינוי הסכומים\") and the footer.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** הפקדה מוטבת, הרווח הריאלי, ותק, משכורת קובעת, נאמנות, קופת גמל להשקעה, דמי נאמן, and \"מיטב השתלמות S&P500 (13245)\" (what's the number?). I also had no idea what the underlined percentages and dotted shekel figures do.\n\n**Where I got tired:** the \"6 שנים\" thing is repeated in maybe five places. By the middle (the taxes part) I was scrolling fast. Every block ends with the same little \"חוקים וכללים · N\" chip, and after a while I stopped seeing them. Also, the page compares against some firm, \"פייר פיננשיאל טכנולוג'יז\", that I've never heard of."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4435,"cache_read_input_tokens":15346,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4435},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"da4fe99f-e438-454e-adfd-10fefb324e41","uuid":"a5dab04d-fc0b-4c78-b006-af5af3071227","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:22:23.900Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmyu5gGENtY4J534TYS5"}
